---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="FAQ | Rajendra Criminal Law Firm" description="Frequently asked questions." canonical="https://criminaladvocate.in/faq/">
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl text-navy mb-8">Frequently Asked Questions</h1>
    <div class="space-y-6">
      <div><h2 class="font-serif text-xl text-navy">I need a quote. Whom do I contact?</h2><p class="text-ink/80 mt-2">Make an appointment with a senior advocate. Initial consultation may be available. Fees are discussed after understanding the matter.</p></div>
      <div><h2 class="font-serif text-xl text-navy">Do you handle bail matters?</h2><p class="text-ink/80 mt-2">Yes. The firm handles regular bail, anticipatory bail, and related applications before courts in Chennai.</p></div>
      <div><h2 class="font-serif text-xl text-navy">What are your office hours?</h2><p class="text-ink/80 mt-2">Office consultations by appointment. Emergency assistance is available.</p></div>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-10 text-sm"><a href="/contact" class="text-navy hover:text-crimson">Contact</a></p>
  </section>
</Layout>
